## 2. Unique Normalized Lift

Evaluate the exact q79 K3 sextic at the selected lifted line. Its monic
sextic has a unique lift of the selected coprime cubic factorization. The
factor Hensel system has shape `6 x 6` and rank 6. It emits

```text
